{"timestamp": "2025-10-18T11:37:55Z", "tool": "Edit", "parameters": {"file_path": "/Users/matifuentes/Workspace/valeriiahereha/index.html", "old_string": "        <!-- Experience Section -->\n        <section id=\"experience\" class=\"content-section\">\n            <div class=\"section-inner\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Experience</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"experience-timeline\">\n                    <div class=\"experience-item\">\n                        <div class=\"experience-header\">\n                            <h3 class=\"experience-title\">Komische Oper Berlin</h3>\n                            <p class=\"experience-date\">2024 - Present</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"experience-role\">Ballet Dancer</p>\n                        <p class=\"section-text\">\n                            Performing in the production of <strong>Salome</strong>, choreographed by Martina Borroni.\n                            Richard Strauss's opera featuring innovative contemporary ballet integration.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"experience-item\">\n                        <div class=\"experience-header\">\n                            <h3 class=\"experience-title\">Commedia Futura</h3>\n                            <p class=\"experience-date\">2024</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"experience-role\">Contemporary Dancer</p>\n                        <p class=\"section-text\">\n                            Performed in <strong>MYCELIA</strong>, choreographed by Minako Seki. An interdisciplinary\n                            contemporary dance piece exploring interconnectedness through organic movement and visual artistry.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"experience-item\">\n                        <div class=\"experience-header\">\n                        